        "description": {
          "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] moves up to its Speed without provoking &amp;Reference[OpportunityAttacks] and can move through the spaces of [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=FG9rAj3Q8UTxbGLF]]. Each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=FG9rAj3Q8UTxbGLF]] whose space the [[lookup @name lowercase]] enters is targeted once by the following effect.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=FG9rAj3Q8UTxbGLF]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition.</p>",
